Annotates 8 additional entity hot-path methods for DAG scheduler
parallelism analysis:

Entity:
  - baseTick() — self field reads/writes (boarding, fire, fluid, firstTick)

LivingEntity:
  - baseTick() — attack anim, air supply, hurt timers, death check
  - travel() — fluid-state read, deltaMovement write, move() dispatch
  - checkFallDamage() — fallDistance/onGround read, lastClimbablePos write
  - hurtServer() — GLOBAL_RW conservative (reads damage source entity)
  - doHurtTarget() — self + target entity read, lastHurtMob write

Mob:
  - baseTick() — ambient sound timer, 1 random call
  - doHurtTarget() — self + target read, weapon damage, knockback

Total annotated entity methods: 17 (up from 9 in previous batch)

